  unitName: Holy Emperor Karna Masta
  unitId: 51317
  unitNumber: 1735
  description: Though the Holy Emperor was cast down into another world during the
    battle with the Oracle Knight, this was only due to the betrayal of the Sealed
    Gods. Had the Holy Emperor not been caught off guard, both his foes surely would
    have fallen easily. However, even if Karna Masta had defeated the Sealed Gods
    and learned of their full plan, any alterations to the efforts to annihilate
    humanity seem to have been inconceivable. Karna Masta viewed any signs of revolt
    against his rule as sinful, regardless of the reason. Without anywhere to flee
    to, humanity likely would have been brutally exterminated.
  summonDesc: Child...you must worship me.<br>I am the one true Holy Emperor! No
    rebellion against me shall be forgiven!
  fusionDesc: My faithful servant...<br>Wielder of the summoning that I created.
    I commend your loyalty.
